{"unit_id":"SundaeYAGO__dsh-stream-timeout-fix#feature-1","repo":"SundaeYAGO/dsh-stream-timeout-fix","commit":"47e7e8b5889b088460884a26525bab636b358a93","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-stream-timeout-fix 的功能「延长流静默超时」：为全局 undici Agent 设置 bodyTimeout，允许 LLM SSE 流在较长字节间隔后继续。插件挂载时自动生效，默认值为 30 分钟。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:97-120"]}
